{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GeTrix is a modern reinvention of the classic block-falling game, powered by intuitive <strong>gesture controls, </strong>where a camera tracks your hands. Whether you're stacking solo or waving your way through the challenge mode, GeTrix delivers a fresh and futuristic twist to a timeless favorite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u270b <strong>How It Works \u2013 Gesture Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play using just your hand and a webcam:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc4a <strong>Face your right fist toward the camera</strong> to start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u261d\ufe0f <strong>Index finger</strong> \u2013 Move block <strong>left</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd19 <strong>Pinky finger</strong> \u2013 Move block <strong>right</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc4d <strong>Thumb</strong> \u2013 <strong>Rotate</strong> block</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd95 <strong>Middle finger</strong> \u2013 <strong>Drop</strong> block faster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prefer traditional controls? Use your <strong>keyboard </strong>to play classic-style too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682260?t=1746135928","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682260?t=1746135928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682260/631e7e718e5f66357e763dbfc86ea6f086baf0d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746135928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682260/631e7e718e5f66357e763dbfc86ea6f086baf0d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746135928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GeTrix is a modern reinvention of the classic block-falling game, powered by intuitive <strong>gesture controls, </strong>where a camera tracks your hands. Whether you're stacking solo or waving your way through the challenge mode, GeTrix delivers a fresh and futuristic twist to a timeless favorite.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u270b <strong>How It Works \u2013 Gesture Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play using just your hand and a webcam:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc4a <strong>Face your right fist toward the camera</strong> to start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u261d\ufe0f <strong>Index finger</strong> \u2013 Move block <strong>left</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd19 <strong>Pinky finger</strong> \u2013 Move block <strong>right</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc4d <strong>Thumb</strong> \u2013 <strong>Rotate</strong> block</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd95 <strong>Middle finger</strong> \u2013 <strong>Drop</strong> block faster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prefer traditional controls? Use your <strong>keyboard </strong>to play classic-style too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["ToGGy"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682260/899e77cd6a8f8c4b18d62ec7bd87d7ac34556191/header.jpg?t=1746135928","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131520,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131520/movie480.mp4?t=1746135925","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131520/movie_max.mp4?t=1746135925"},"name":"GeTrixTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131520